  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>70688</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100701</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>待ちかねたぞ
&lt;Shing&gt;＝メテオライト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've been waiting, Shing Meteoryte.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>70816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100702</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カルセドニー……今度こそ
&lt;Kohaku&gt;のスピルーンを
返してもらうぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chalcedony... This time, we're talking &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s Spirune back!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>71348</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100703</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どーした、息が荒いよ？
ひょっとして、お姉さんとの
戦いで緊張してるのかぁ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aww, what's wrong? You scared of fighting a big sister?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>71476</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100704</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふんだ！
卑怯者たちが白々しいよっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph! Takes a coward to know one!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>71604</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100705</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんの事だ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's the matter?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>71732</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100706</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この期におよんで
話し合いは無意味だろう。
騎士らしくソーマで白黒をつけよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Discussion is meaningless. Let us knights Soma decide once and for all who is right, and who is wrong.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>71860</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100707</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>騎士なんて知るか！
オレは&lt;Kohaku&gt;と混乱した
世界を元に戻したいだけだ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't care about “knights” or anything like that! All I wanna do is get Kohaku and this crazy world back to normal!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72092</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100708</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、お前はそういう男だ。
だが、私にも譲れない想いが……
スピリアに誓った約束がある</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know, that's just the kind of man you are. However there is a feeling I will not give up on... an oath I swore on my Spiria.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72092</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100709</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今こそ互いの想いを
ソーマの刃に変え……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now, let our feelings become our Soma's blades...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72456</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100710</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どちらが強いか比べ合おう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And see who's proved to be the strongest!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72896</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100711</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はは……なんか
嬉しそうだぞ、カルセドニー？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haha...you look pretty happy, Chalcedony!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>73024</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100712</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふん、メテオライト……
貴様もなッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph, I could say the same... Meteoryte!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76452</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100801</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カルセドニー……
オレの……
いや、オレたちの勝ちだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chalcedony...this is my... no, OUR victory!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100802</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>くうぅ、まだだ！
私の……僕の想いは
まだ折れていないッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Damn it, this isn't over! My feelings... haven't given out yet!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>78428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100803</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もうやめて……
これ以上戦ったら……
あなたの体が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's enough... if you keeping fighting in this state, you'll...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>78784</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100804</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『オレたちの勝ち』……か……
お前のソーマには、想いを共に
した者の力も宿っているのだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>“Our victory” huh... so you're Soma bears not only your feelings, but those who believe in your cause as well.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>79096</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100805</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………私の負け……だ。
約束通りスピルーンを返そう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I admit defeat. I will return the Spirune as we agreed.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>79096</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100806</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ぐぅぅ……ッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tch...!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>80952</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100807</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……さぁ、もって行け</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Here, take it..</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>85752</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100808</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>てめぇ、何をしやがる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The hell you playin' at?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>85880</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100809</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よくやった、バイロクス！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well done, Byrox.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>86380</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100810</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>父上……なぜここに!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Father... what are you doing here?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>90068</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S100811</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うわあぁぁ〜〜〜…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aaaahh!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>94964</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101101</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カルセドニー！
話は聞いたぞ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chalcedony! We heard everything!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>95920</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101102</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……すまん、本当に知らなかった
のだ。私は聖堂を空にするよう
手配したのだが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I am terribly sorry, I truly did not know. I had arranged for the catherdral to be empty, however...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>96264</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101103</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カル様……
私が教主様に報告し
騎士団に迎撃させたのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lord Chal... I was the one who reported this to Father, who then sent the knights to intervene.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>96768</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101104</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>バイロクス……
お前が……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Byrox... why would you...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>96896</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101105</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はぁぁ〜〜何それ!?
聞いてないよッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>EXCUSE ME?! Why didn't I hear anything about this?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>97024</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101106</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カル様のためです！
この者たちを、なんとしても
捕らえねば……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I did this all for Lord Chal's sake! We needed to capture these people at all costs...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>97024</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101107</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>皇帝陛下に対して
カル様の身の潔白が示せません！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We need them to prove Lord Chal's innocence!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>97152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101108</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふん、そんなものは
我ら教会を攻めるための
口実にすぎん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph, that is clearly just a ruse in order to attack our church.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>97152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101109</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>グロシュラーと軍を打ち破れば
どうにでもなるわ。それよりも
重要なのは、その娘の確保だ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As long as we can defeat Grossular and his army, there will be nothing to worry about. More importantly, we must secure the girl!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>97152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101110</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アイオラの娘に宿る
リチアの力こそ、予が十数年
探し続けてきたものなのだからな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lithia's power that resides within Iola's daughter... that is what I've spent over ten years searching for!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>97684</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101111</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あなたは……
お母さんとリチアを
……知ってるの!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How... do you know about Lithia... and my mom?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>97980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101112</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、軍がソーマ使い並みの力を
持つゼロム兵を実戦投入してる事は
ご存じないみたいね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And yet you seem oblivious to the fact the army is sending xeromorphic soldiers, whose power's rival even a Somatic, to battle?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>98344</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101113</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんだ……と？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What... did you say?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>99320</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101114</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>申し上げます！　聖都南門前に
帝国軍主力と思われる部隊が
展開中。その数およそ十万!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My deepest apologies, sir! It appears the Imperial Army's main forces have been deployed outside the city gates! We estimate roughly 100,00 of them!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>100396</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101115</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うわっ……
ほ、本当に戦争が
始まっちゃうのぉ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh-oh... i-is war really starting THIS second?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>100840</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101116</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>くっ……その話が事実なら
なおさらリチアの力を
手に入れねば……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Curses... if what you say is true, I must obtain Lithia's powers...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>102208</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101117</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カ、カルセドニー……
なんのまねだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C-Chalcedony... what do you think you're doing?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>102336</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101118</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>バイロクス、スピルーンを
メテオライトたちに返すんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Byrox, return the Spirune to them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>102540</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101119</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、カル様！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, Lord Chal...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>102668</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101120</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……頼む、返してやってくれ。
これは僕の、けじめなんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Please. This is an order.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>108188</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101121</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>愚かな……
そのようなこだわりは
現実を知らぬ子どもの戯れ言だぞ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ridiculous... such is the drivel of an ignorant child who can't fathom reality!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>108480</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101122</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>軍の攻撃が始まったのか!?
教主様、至急騎士団にご指示を！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The military is attacking?! Father, we must issue emergency orders to the knights!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>108772</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101123</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>くぅ……この責は負って
もらうぞ、カルセドニーッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grr... this isn't over, Chalcedony!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>110832</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101124</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここから先は
我ら教会と軍の問題だ。
貴様らは聖都から脱出しろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>From this point onward, this is an issue between the church and military. You should all escape the city while you can.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>113024</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101125</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>卑怯なマネをして、すまなかった。
その少女……
&lt;Kohaku&gt;の回復を祈る</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sorry for showing such cowardice. And I pray for the girl... no, Kohaku's swift recovery.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>113476</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101126</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ヤツの意見に同意する。
すみやかに、この街から
脱出すべきだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I agree with that course of action. We should evacuate the city as soon a possible</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>113764</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101127</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Ines&gt;。
今、教会と軍がぶつかったら
どうなるかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ines, what do you think's gonna happen now the church and military are fighting?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>113892</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101128</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おそらく物量差で軍の圧勝よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's possible the army could win by a landslide thanks to their sheer numbers.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>113892</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101129</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>仕掛けたからには、結晶騎士と
同数以上のゼロム兵を揃えていると
考えるべきだもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Seeing as they've been planning thos for some time, i think it's safe to assume they'd have at least as many xeromorphic soldiers as there are Crystal Knights.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>113892</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101130</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>けど、ゼロム兵でも
この街の城門は簡単には
突破できないはず……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even so, I doubt it would be that easy for them to break though the city gates...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>113892</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101131</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>篭城しつつ和平交渉の道を探るしか
教会の生き残る道はないと思うわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I feel like the church's only option is to try and begin peace talks while holding down the fort.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>114440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101132</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……待ってよ。
確かオーブさんたちを襲った部隊に
教会の人が一緒にいたよねぇ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Oh no, wait a minute. Wasn't there also a member of the church in that gang that attacked Obe, yeah?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>114440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101133</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>逃がしちゃったけど
アレって裏切り者なんじゃないの？
もし、あいつが城門を開けたら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What is he was a traitor and we just let him go? If he opens the castle gates from the inside...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>114932</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101134</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……市内が戦場になる……
そんなのダメだよッ！
わたしは…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...The city would become a battlefield... that'd be horrible...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>114932</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101135</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この戦争をとめたいッ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We have to stop this war!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>115496</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S101136</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここまで関わりあったのに
ほってなんかおけないよ。
オレたちも南門へ向おう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well we've come this far, there's no point turning around now. Let's hurry to the south gate!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
